{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And He said.</b> A sign and a portent, like (Ezekiel 24:24) \"and Ezekiel will be a portent for you.\"" "And the meaning of <b>three years</b>: for three years from this day, or three years Egypt will be in famine."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:23.179992713Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}